+| Spec module | Claims covered | Exit | Result |
+|---|---:|---:|---|
+| `FIX-SPACES-FLUSH-SPEC` | 4 | 0 | `#Top` |
+| `FIX-SPACES-STEP-SPEC` | 2 | 0 | `#Top` |
