+2. Haskell `FIX-SPACES-BASE`;
+3. Haskell `FIX-SPACES-FLUSH-VERIFICATION`;
+4. Haskell `FIX-SPACES-STEP-VERIFICATION`;
+5. Haskell `FIX-SPACES-VERIFICATION`.
